      bodyEn: "The standard pattern: 你是哪国人? (nǐ shì nǎ guórén) — literally \"you + are + which + country + person?\". Compact but very regular.\nAnswer: 我是 + [nationality]. E.g. 我是法国人 (wǒ shì fǎguórén) — \"I am French\".",
