      bodyEn: "Classifier depends on the container.\n\n- 个 (gè) — standard dishes, general (三个菜 = 3 dishes)\n- 碗 (wǎn) — anything served in a bowl (rice, soup, noodles) — 一碗米饭\n- 杯 (bēi) — anything served in a glass (tea, juice, beer) — 一杯茶\n- 瓶 (píng) — bottles — 一瓶啤酒\n\nNEVER say 一个茶: it's 一杯茶.",
